OL,3,GNEWSAStalking laws must change to save
OL,4,Alives, family says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe review of current legislation by
OL,7,FRichard Wright KC was submitted to
OL,8,Fministers six months ago. Clive Ruggles
OL,9,Fsaid: "We've got to do something about
OL,10,Fthis and that involves just the
OL,11,Fgovernment acting - get this report
OL,12,Fout."
OL,14,FThe government said the stalking
OL,15,Flegislation review and its response
OL,16,Fwould be published "imminently" and it
OL,17,Fwas strengthening the use of stalking
OL,18,Fprotection orders.
